[ENT-02] fpp3 1.0.3 · tsibble 1.2.0 · feasts 0.5.0 · ggtime 0.2.0
[ENT-03] locale: C
[ENT-04] UKgas: paquete datasets ; n = 108 ; frecuencia 4 ; de 1960-1 a 1986-4
[ENT-04] nottem: paquete datasets ; n = 240 ; frecuencia 12 ; de 1920-1 a 1939-12
[ENT-04] mdeaths: paquete datasets ; n = 72 ; frecuencia 12 ; de 1974-1 a 1979-12
[ENT-04] fdeaths: paquete datasets ; n = 72 ; frecuencia 12 ; de 1974-1 a 1979-12

--- que es cada serie, segun la ayuda de R ---
[ENT-05 ?UKgas] UK Quarterly Gas Consumption
[ENT-05 ?UKgas] Description:
[ENT-05 ?UKgas]      Quarterly UK gas consumption from 1960Q1 to 1986Q4, in millions of
[ENT-05 ?UKgas]      therms.
[ENT-05 ?nottem] Average Monthly Temperatures at Nottingham, 1920-1939
[ENT-05 ?nottem] Description:
[ENT-05 ?nottem]      A time series object containing average air temperatures at
[ENT-05 ?nottem]      Nottingham Castle in degrees Fahrenheit for 20 years.
[ENT-05 ?UKLungDeaths] Monthly Deaths from Lung Diseases in the UK
[ENT-05 ?UKLungDeaths] Description:
[ENT-05 ?UKLungDeaths]      Three time series giving the monthly deaths from bronchitis,
[ENT-05 ?UKLungDeaths]      emphysema and asthma in the UK, 1974-1979, both sexes ('ldeaths'),
[ENT-05 ?UKLungDeaths]      males ('mdeaths') and females ('fdeaths').

